{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_07313","headline":"宿怀仁县南湖寄东海荀处士 · 刘长卿","name":"宿怀仁县南湖寄东海荀处士","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"向夕歛微雨，晴开湖上天。\n离人正惆怅，新月愁婵娟。\n伫立白沙曲，相思沧海边。\n浮云自来去，此意谁能传。\n一水不相见，千峰随客船。\n寒塘起孤雁，夜色分盐田。\n时复一延首，忆君如眼前。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"刘长卿","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_07313.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_07313","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}